Implement user story EPAM-HC-004: Health Check: Claude CLI (Proxy Mode)

## Story Description
Verify that the Claude CLI binary works correctly when routed through the EPAM proxy backend. Confirms that authenticated proxy calls succeed and that the response format is identical to the direct path tested in EPAM-HC-001.

## Acceptance Criteria
- Claude CLI is invoked with EPAM_BACKEND_URL set to the proxy endpoint
- A trivial prompt ('echo hello') is sent and a response is received within 30 seconds
- The response output parses as valid JSON with expected fields (result, usage)
- Response is identical in structure to the direct-path response from EPAM-HC-001

